### `GroupView`

Supported platforms: Android.

Enables the view to be used as a view group. Definition components that are accepted as part of the group view definition: [`AddChildView`](/modules/module-api.md#addchildview), [`GetChildCount`](/modules/module-api.md#getchildcount), [`GetChildViewAt`](/modules/module-api.md#getchildviewat), [`RemoveChildView`](/modules/module-api.md#removechildview), [`RemoveChildViewAt`](/modules/module-api.md#removechildviewat).

